{"componentChunkName":"component---src-templates-areaguide-detail-template-js","path":"/area-guides/dubai-healthcare-city/","result":{"data":{"strapiAreaGuide":{"id":"c086b895-9b39-59e4-b6b7-2b6cfafdb1a3","description":{"data":{"description":"<p>Dubai Healthcare City was launched in the year 2002 with a single aim to meet demand for high quality, patient centred healthcare.</p>"}},"video_ask_url":null,"amenities":{"strapi_json_value":["Near Metro"],"id":"f25fed34-2fe5-53f7-ab3e-df5f89a00c57"},"title":"Dubai Healthcare City","tile_image":{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/dubai_healthcare_city_0e4b0bf48a.jpg"},"masterplan_image":null,"sponsored_projects":[],"teams":[],"strapi_id":81,"slug":"dubai-healthcare-city","custom_property_slug":null,"publish":true,"more_info":[],"longitude":55.3223707,"latitude":25.2304174,"content":{"data":{"content":"<p>Dubai Healthcare City (DHCC) is a renowned healthcare and medical free zone in Dubai, dedicated to advancing the healthcare industry and providing world-class medical services. Situated in the heart of Dubai, DHCC is home to a wide range of healthcare facilities, including hospitals, clinics, and research centers.</p><p>This thriving healthcare community is known for its commitment to excellence and innovation in healthcare. It offers specialized medical services, advanced diagnostic and treatment options, and a comprehensive healthcare ecosystem. DHCC also hosts a medical university, providing education and training to healthcare professionals.</p><p>Patients and visitors to DHCC benefit from its state-of-the-art healthcare facilities, renowned medical expertise, and easy access to a wide range of medical specialties. The free zone's strategic location ensures convenient access for both residents and international patients seeking quality medical care in Dubai.</p>"}},"ggfx_results":[{"src_cftle":"i/dubai_healthcare_city_banner_b0e239a784.jpg","transforms":[{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate